    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont see how that works in 2024. if the goal is to prevent \"tyranny of the majority\" shouldn't the goal be to make sure every single person's vote actually counts equally? right now it feels like if you live in a small state it matters way more than if you live in a big one. isnt that just inherently undemocratic? like, is there any way to fix it that isnt just abolishing it entirely?",
